  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the area enclosed between the curves&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then <math><mi>k</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1ve0C",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1NsY2",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Zs2vl",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1THv9",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given curves are,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>To find the point of intersection of the curves, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;from the first curve into second, to get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Therefore, point of intersection is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/gbhijmiscyzgtsmittgegdvsifflkjlflcrteinbowkrzvjwge.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 216px;\" /><br /><br />Hence, the required area is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>But, given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
